      "id": "be-s8-cost-concepts-c1",
      "heading": "Types of costs",
      "explanation_md": "In the **short run** a firm has **fixed costs (FC)**, **sunk costs**, **variable costs (VC)** and **total costs (TC)**.\n\nIn the **long run** **all costs are variable**: there are **no fixed costs**, because the firm can change every input.",
